  "body": "People are commonly abusing these for spoofing purposes or to trap users on the page in various ways.  Firefox has moved to not firing them in some situations in which they have no reasonable use case (see https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=636905 for example).\n\nIt might be worth sitting down and figuring out what should actually be MUST-level here and what should become SHOULD-level requirements and what should be MAY-level, etc.\n",
